## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design low-level, concurrent IPC with NUMA locality and fault handling, not just theory.

## Key Concepts
- NUMA locality
- per-page state machines
- CAS-based race avoidance
- page fault paths (local fetch, zero-fill, read-ahead)
- fairness via per-producer credits

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo per-page state CAS
let state = 'free';
function claim() {
  if (state === 'free') {
    state = 'in-flight';
    return true;
  }
  return false;
}
```

